      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PEEPING PETE (5) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from five starts. In the money last time at Angle Park (20.19) in a Grade 6, finishing a 12 length third. Rates on top and should go close. ACHILLES LEGEND (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 4 length win at this track in a handy 17.28. Has the coveted inside box and likes the trip. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Will go close again if runs up to latest. ZIPPING BELUGA (8) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Placed last time (17.28) at this track in a TG1-4W, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. CATCHING (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
